<Content/>
<OdiaConnectedReading current="rise-children-of-utkal"/>
<p><a href="/contribute/?page=%2Fstories%2Frise-children-of-utkal%2F">Suggest an update</a>. GitHub submissions are public; omit private contact details and consent documents.</p>
</article></Shell>
<style>article :global(img){max-width:100%;height:auto}article :global(.footnotes h2){position:static;width:auto;height:auto;clip:auto;clip-path:none;overflow:visible;white-space:normal}article :global(.footnotes){margin-top:3rem}</style>
